    "featured_collection_Amz4K6": {
      "type": "featured-collection",
      "settings": {
        "title": "<strong>Why Our Glass Railings Stand Out</strong>",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "description": "<p>Our Quakertown glass railings combine durability, safety, and style while being easy to maintain. They improve light flow and provide wide, clear views without compromising space or aesthetics.</p><ul><li><strong>Custom-Made Solutions</strong> – Designed to match your specific space and style.</li><li><strong>High-Quality Materials</strong> – Built with sturdy tempered or laminated glass and corrosion-resistant fittings.</li><li><strong>Simple Installation</strong> – Step-by-step guides and support help you install every railing precisely for lasting stability.</li><li><strong>Competitive Pricing</strong> – High-end designs at reasonable costs.</li><li><strong>Climate-Resistant Build</strong> – Engineered to withstand Quakertown’ bright sun and occasional weather shifts.</li></ul>",
